{
"file": 146,
"paths": [
"d007/d005/f065"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "d21a448c",
"en_raw": "I was watching that TV show"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "c6b26b43",
"en_raw": "at the neighborhood barber's, and"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "b2fec328",
"en_raw": "the barber starts saying"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "8c52ecd1",
"en_raw": "crazy stuff while cutting my hair"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "e884c647",
"en_raw": "...The Edo shogunate's buried treasure?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "79e640b7",
"en_raw": "He said some is buried in Hirumi too"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "c69ffe68",
"en_raw": "There's a forest behind the Tsukazato bus stop"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "9be12c7b",
"en_raw": "After the haircut, I"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "0a5b3149",
"en_raw": "was shown some old map..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "daa0a884",
"en_raw": "Hey, Murase, what are you eavesdropping for?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9e1dfec2",
"en_raw": "No, it's nothing"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "4162d6ba",
"en_raw": "Then go away"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3d31252f",
"en_raw": "What are you hiding?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "eaa3b136",
"en_raw": "...It's fine, whatever"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "5e487d6e",
"en_raw": "About that treasure, let's all look for it"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "4f1c43a5",
"en_raw": "Huh, Nishi?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "fceec1e6",
"en_raw": "You want me to tell him too?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "1a7b8f65",
"en_raw": "It's fine, Take"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "3dcc8d47",
"en_raw": "Takayuki says it's okay"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "955b1d34",
"en_raw": "Fine"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "3d5ca61d",
"en_raw": "...Anyway, there's a treasure marker in the forest"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "cc21296c",
"en_raw": "A canopy in the forest? ...A turret, was it?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0b1af114",
"en_raw": "No, hmm, I think it was okra, maybe"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "38f7dffe",
"en_raw": "That thing in the forest is the marker"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "fc92b7dc",
"en_raw": "What's a forest okra?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "51277906",
"en_raw": "Then, Murase"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "879cfea0",
"en_raw": "you go investigate that"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "e83168ef",
"en_raw": "But never tell anyone about the treasure"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "23e8db70",
"en_raw": "Did you find out about the okra?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "38ae4dbb",
"en_raw": "Oh, no, not yet, but..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "0a7d3a22",
"en_raw": "Then go find out quick!"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "45a4847a",
"en_raw": "Um, it's not okra"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "1d8a8113",
"en_raw": "it's a shrine, apparently"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f61c9c9f",
"en_raw": "Oh yeah, that!"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "168772b4",
"en_raw": "I just remembered"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "fb5bd9db",
"en_raw": "It's not a shrine, it's okra!"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "7605c357",
"en_raw": "That's the treasure marker!"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "46017b9b",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Forest Treasure"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2f1b91e5",
"en_raw": "Murase, don't you dare skip out"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a1ab1fb3",
"en_raw": "We found it first, you know"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "19e8b4ef",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I have to..."
}
]
}